          "type": "pause",
          "args": "1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$6I find myself drawn to this library. These old texts... they speak of empires rising and falling on the whims of a few.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$0It reminds me of the archives I used to study in. Before everything fell apart...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} -1 0 3"
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$8I look at the choices I made, the loyalty I gave to things that only brought ruin... \""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$2...and I wonder if a person like me can ever truly... 'live' with the choices I have made in my... past.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} 1 0 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$0Tell me... \""
        },
        {
          "type": "question",
          "args": "fork0 \"When you carry a burden that cannot be erased, nor fixed... how do you live with it? #(Be honest) You carry it forward, but don't let it define you.#(Offer comfort) You focus on the present. What you can do in the here and now.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "fork",
          "args": "carry_it_forward"
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} 0 0 0"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1The present... You make it sound so simple. But... perhaps it is possible.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "emote",
          "args": "{name} 32"
