          "args": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4I was just... keeping a journal. Jotting down fragments.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$0Trying to make sense of how life can... derail so entirely...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$2How everything went so terribly wrong before I even realized the path I was standing on was... fracturing...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4It's foolish to dwell on it. Out here, the days just... blur into quiet. But the ink dries the same.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$0Tell me... do you ever miss your past life? Before all of this?\""
        },
        {
          "type": "question",
          "args": "fork0 \"My past life... #(Honestly) Yes, sometimes it's hard to let go. #(Reassuringly) No. Everything I need is right here.\""
        },
