          "type": "showFrame",
          "args": "{name} 29"
        },
        {
          "type": "question",
          "args": "fork1 \"You already know who I am and what I have done... will you stay? Will you... keep coming back?#(Step forward and smile) I'm not going anywhere. You're stuck with me.#(Nod gently) Through the quiet and the heavy days, yes I'll stay.\""
