          "args": "1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1Good morning beautiful\""
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} 0 3 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1...You're just in time. Come... watch the sunrise over the crops with me... \""
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "farmer 0 1 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1You know... the sunrise and this warmth it gives is... one of the best parts of my day\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1It reminds me of you\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1It quietly rises and falls every day. Gives warmth and offers opportunities to everyone around.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$6To the young and old, big and small. Both you and the sun are neither here or there for long, always on the move, always busy yet patient all the same.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} 0 0 0"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$0For me, mornings only brought... new problems to solve, new burdens to bear, new orders to follow... new expectations to reach...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"I was always chasing checkpoints and goals, it was all I knew... all I was taught to do... to be... 'seen' in a very busy, very full and lively city.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4Now... as I watch over these lands. It's vast and it's busy... yet it's quiet... it's full of life and it's... patient?\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$7No-one asks me to 'do' more, to 'be' better, to... do things I do not want to do... no expectations, no threats...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$8Neither the sun nor the earth below my feet has any expectation of me to be a weapon, a legend...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "1200"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$6It's... nice... peaceful and... free'ing\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4It doesn't ask nor demand much at all... The land simply wants to be tended to, the sun wishes to be acknowledged... even that is an overshot... \""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4That's why it reminds me of you... The sun... it provides warmth, growth and... just endless possibility... \""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$3You showed me that a man... 'this man' more specifically isn't defined by his achievements nor the shadow of his past...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4You spend everyday bringing joy and peace and... happiness to everything and everyone you touch... and you ask ...nothing in return\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$3I want you to know, that you're like the sun in my life {{ playerName }}... I want you to know that...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$2I regret the choices I made, my actions that led to the consequences in my past life...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"But I don't want spend the days we have together worrying about things I cannot change at all.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} 0 -1 0"
        },
        {
          "type": "showFrame",
          "args": "{name} 10"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$0I don't dread the first rays of sunlight that is promised as tomorrow anymore.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$2Because I have you in my life now... I will do everything I can to ensure your happiness is as endless as the vast ocean you pulled me from.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"To promise you tomorrows as bright and brilliant as the sun itself... Cause that is what you are to me\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$6You are like the sun to me. And I will be... whatever you wish me to be, just promise me...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "args": "{name} 0 -1 0"
        },
        {
          "type": "pause",
          "args": "1000"
        },
        {
          "type": "showFrame",
          "args": "{name} 25"
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$4That you will continue to keep bringing joy... and happiness... and brilliance to all you touch in Stardew Valley.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1And I will do my very best to support your every effort in whichever way you need...\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1I will be your rock, your anchor and I WILL see us through every storm life brings our way. \""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1I will be your steady fence AND your sheltered barn through every harsh winter.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "speak",
          "args": "{name} \"$1Through drought or downpour, my love WILL be the deep roots that keep us standing tall.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "showFrame",
          "args": "{name} 24"
        },
        {
